
==================================================
  CyberShield SOC - Backend Server
  Mobile & Email Security Platform
==================================================
  API Endpoints:
  POST /api/auth/login          - Email login
  POST /api/auth/mobile-login   - Mobile login
  POST /api/auth/verify-otp     - OTP verification
  POST /api/auth/verify-mfa     - MFA verification
  GET  /api/mobile/devices      - List devices
  GET  /api/mobile/scan-apps    - Scan apps
  POST /api/mobile/analyze-sms  - Analyze SMS
  GET  /api/mobile/malware-scan - Malware scan
  GET  /api/mobile/sms-logs     - SMS logs
  GET  /api/mobile/call-logs    - Call logs
  GET  /api/mobile/check-battery- Battery check
  GET  /api/mobile/device-health- Device health
  GET  /api/mobile/dashboard-stats- Dashboard
  POST /api/email/check-spf     - SPF check
  POST /api/email/check-dkim    - DKIM check
  POST /api/email/check-dmarc   - DMARC check
  POST /api/email/analyze-headers- Headers
  POST /api/email/phishing-scan - Phishing
  POST /api/email/scan-url      - URL scan
  GET  /api/reports/download-pdf - PDF report
  GET  /api/reports/download-csv - CSV export
  GET  /api/reports/download-json- JSON export
==================================================
  Server starting on http://localhost:5000
